\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces The filter's decision order. Cheap field checks precede the MinHash comparison so obvious junk never reaches the expensive path --- but the signature is computed \emph  {first}, unconditionally, so a rejected post can still be compared against later arrivals. No branch discards a post: every verdict is persisted with its reason, which is the only thing that makes the filter's own precision measurable after the fact. Thresholds shown are the shipped defaults.}}{10}{figure.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:filter}{{7}{10}{The filter's decision order. Cheap field checks precede the MinHash comparison so obvious junk never reaches the expensive path --- but the signature is computed \emph {first}, unconditionally, so a rejected post can still be compared against later arrivals. No branch discards a post: every verdict is persisted with its reason, which is the only thing that makes the filter's own precision measurable after the fact. Thresholds shown are the shipped defaults}{figure.caption.11}{}}
