\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Why the reservation must be one statement. The \texttt  {\small  WHERE} clause lives inside the upsert, so the check and the increment are a single atomic operation and the loser of the race is told it lost. A read followed by a write lets both workers observe the same headroom and both spend it --- at \$0.005 a read, silently.}}{11}{figure.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:budget}{{8}{11}{Why the reservation must be one statement. The \code {WHERE} clause lives inside the upsert, so the check and the increment are a single atomic operation and the loser of the race is told it lost. A read followed by a write lets both workers observe the same headroom and both spend it --- at \$0.005 a read, silently}{figure.caption.12}{}}
